8X","text":"Danboと聞いて","ts":"1625545630.151200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81c3e160-dd97-4c2e-a0c5-597ddf1d1b29","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なんかこう、ラーメン屋のラーメンって、店にも寄るとは思うんですけど、値段の大半はスープにかかってるって知って、それってつまりラーメン食べてスープ残すって上澄みだけ食べて残り捨ててるみたいな気がしてしまって、それってそもそもラーメン食べる意味なくない? みたいに感じてしまっているので食べるときは飲んでしまう… (※個人の見解です)","ts":"1625544121.150900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4rw2x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9863aff-2703-4c1e-bc68-0cc60abfd831","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"油そば、スープ無いので全部食べられて便利","ts":"1625543933.149000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DgZm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfddfcfc-d9db-4b9a-8ae9-2e23936cfeac","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"でも、ラーメンは全部スープを飲むことのほうが少ないなぁ…","ts":"1625543911.148600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jO3eB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd8491b1-237d-4739-9d0e-690d28cf2fca","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ラーメンは無理をしないと食べられなくなってきているのでもっぱらカレーに流れ気味です","ts":"1625543823.148100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WOUlG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8f8dae4-1d8e-44f6-bd21-9b254be39730","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"ランチで麻婆豆腐食べると夜はお尻痛いけど分かってても食べてしまう","ts":"1625543707.147500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8MM7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46273b7b-db18-4411-8b1b-8a868c496a49","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"若い体がほしい","ts":"1625543429.146000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lbm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bedc23d-d8f0-40b5-8379-fd63455f7359","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おなか下す前に食べてる最中に気持ち悪くなっちゃうんだよな…つらい…","ts":"1625543413.145800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1H/lQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f6ced51-7432-4e8f-a091-0b89ecfe81a8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"先に牛乳飲んどくと良いかも？胃に膜が張れるから","ts":"1625543370.145400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nqYB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4EF53DBA-BAA8-4269-B29A-B55CAD330C55","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ニンニク抜き、背脂抜き、スープ飲まないとか、色々試したんですけど、100%お腹降すので諦めて全部食べるスタイルになりました。","ts":"1625542903.144900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FTFm="}]},{"client_msg_id":"DBB999C7-965D-4930-A290-188C322C09FE","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"辛いもの食べて次の日おしり痛いみたいけど、辛いの好きだから食べちゃうみたいな感じなのかも。","ts":"1625542687.142900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9MFE0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29026279-5E05-46FF-9FC8-22346BA95A35","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"もう背脂抜きでないと無理\nニンニクも好きだったけれどこれもなあ","ts":"1625542680.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c869d1f-d75f-4677-8337-0d62a513f2e3","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"負けない心つよい","ts":"1625542364.141100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qdv4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02